{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46198","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十二 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠窦烟岩画不成，桂华瀑沫杂芳馨。\n拨霞扫雪和云母，掘石移松得茯苓。\n好鸟傍花窥玉磬，嫩苔和水没金缾。\n从他人说从他笑，地覆天翻也只宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}